# play sub-menu/03-dns-empty -----------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the gallery's$
# fixture plans. Nothing on this machine changes: the simulated$
# system only records each step it would apply, and the record$
# is shown when play ends.$
$
# DNS Configuration ############################################$
$
# Current DNS Configuration ------------------------------------$
$
   -  DNS Implementation   direct (/etc/resolv.conf)$
   -  Nameservers          192.0.2.1$
   -  Search Domains       example.net$
$
# Configured Nameservers ---------------------------------------$
$
   -  No nameservers configured$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Configure DNS        Apply nameserver settings from con...$
   2) Add nameserver       Add a new DNS server to configuration$
   4) Use Cloudflare DNS   Set nameservers to 1.1.1.1, 1.0.0.1$
   5) Use Google DNS       Set nameservers to 8.8.8.8, 8.8.4.4$
   6) Use Quad9 DNS        Set nameservers to 9.9.9.9, 149.11...$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2, 4-6 or q]: 3$
  (x) Invalid option. Please try again.$
  > Enter selection [0-2, 4-6 or q]: 1$
$
# Warning$
# Please add nameservers first.$
$
# DNS Configuration ############################################$
$
# Current DNS Configuration ------------------------------------$
$
   -  DNS Implementation   direct (/etc/resolv.conf)$
   -  Nameservers          192.0.2.1$
   -  Search Domains       example.net$
$
# Configured Nameservers ---------------------------------------$
$
   -  No nameservers configured$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Configure DNS        Apply nameserver settings from con...$
   2) Add nameserver       Add a new DNS server to configuration$
   4) Use Cloudflare DNS   Set nameservers to 1.1.1.1, 1.0.0.1$
   5) Use Google DNS       Set nameservers to 8.8.8.8, 8.8.4.4$
   6) Use Quad9 DNS        Set nameservers to 9.9.9.9, 149.11...$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2, 4-6 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

